# Testing & CI Rules

- Use `node scripts/run-tests.js` to run all package tests locally
- Web route smoke test: `node apps/web/test-all-pages.js` (auto-detects 3000-3004)
- Server tests use Jest with in-memory Mongo; disable rate limits in `NODE_ENV=test`
- Prefer testing hooks/components with Testing Library; avoid enzyme
- Snapshots sparingly; prefer assertions on text and roles
- For flaky network code, mock with MSW/axios-mock-adapter where available
